sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Delivery planner
    participant F as Frontend (SPA)
    participant W as Web App (C2)
    participant DB as Database (cache/queue)
    participant Q as Queue Worker (C3)
    participant API as OpenStreet TSP API
    participant WS as Reverb (C4)

    Note over F,WS: On load, SPA opens a persistent WebSocket and<br/>subscribes to private-App.Models.User.{id}
    F->>WS: subscribe private user channel (wss)
    F->>W: POST /broadcasting/auth
    W-->>F: 200 channel authorized

    U->>F: Submit coordinates
    F->>W: POST /api/tour/optimize (session cookie)
    W->>W: validate + normalize (sha256 hash)
    W->>DB: getTour(userId, hash)

    alt Cache hit (instant)
        DB-->>W: cached route
        W-->>F: 200 {status: done, data}
        F-->>U: Render route immediately
    else Cache miss (async)
        DB-->>W: null
        W->>DB: claimInflight(userId, hash, jobUuid) [atomic add]
        alt Lost claim — identical request already running
            DB-->>W: claim refused
            W->>DB: getInflight(userId, hash)
            DB-->>W: existing jobUuid
            W-->>F: 202 {status: pending, job_uuid} (reused)
        else Won claim
            DB-->>W: claim ok
            W->>DB: markPending(jobUuid)
            W->>DB: enqueue OptimizeTourJob
            W-->>F: 202 {status: pending, job_uuid}
        end
        F-->>U: Show "optimizing…" (UI never blocks)

        Note over Q,API: Background thread — request already returned
        Q->>DB: reserve job
        Q->>API: GET /api/tsp (15s connect / 600s read, 1 retry)

        alt API success
            API-->>Q: optimized tour
            Q->>DB: clearInflight + putTour(24h) + markDone
            Q->>WS: push TourOptimized (HTTP/Pusher, via broadcasts queue)
            WS-->>F: TourOptimized {job_uuid, data} (wss)
            F-->>U: Render route the instant API answered
        else API failure / timeout / crash
            API-->>Q: error / timeout
            Q->>DB: clearInflight + markFailed
            Q->>WS: push TourOptimizationFailed
            WS-->>F: TourOptimizationFailed {job_uuid, error}
            F-->>U: Show error
        end

        opt WebSocket missed (fallback polling)
            F->>W: GET /api/tour/status/{job_uuid}
            W->>DB: getJobStatus(jobUuid)
            DB-->>W: pending | done | failed
            W-->>F: 200 status (or 404)
        end
    end
